Running on local
Create a Playbook with host as localhost
It may ask sudo previliges , so user will become: true
---
- name: Ansu's first Playbook
  hosts: localhost


  tasks:
  - name: Test Connectivity
    ping:
  - name: "Print Output"
    debug:  msg="Wroking Fine"
